- invCost(l,r) as block cost (inversions within subarray)
- Reconstruction pointers for block boundaries
- Time: O(n^2 k); Space: O(nk) or O(nk) with rolling arrays

## Code Example
```javascript
function precomputeInv(a){
  const n=a.length; const inv=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(0));
  for(let l=0;l<n;l++){
    let cnt=0;
    for(let r=l;r<n;r++){
      for(let i=l;i<r;i++) if(a[i]>a[r]) cnt++;
      inv[l][r]=cnt;
    }
  }
  return inv;
}
```

